#: 9b3618e3c7364386bc6265b8a782a56b
msgid "While it is possible to use :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` = 2, to allow arming and disarming via the throttle and rudder sticks, this could allow accidental disarming in the air. Therefore, it is better to the use an RC channel, controlled by a two or three position switch, to arm and disarm. This can be accomplished by setting the RC channel's ``RCx_OPTION`` to \"153\" ."
